have so many lines?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0007:}}E allora mi spieghi come mai questo
personaggio forzuto e tenebroso
ha così tante battute?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hello there,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} strange little old lady.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Wherefore do you come knocking
on my door today?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Hello there, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001F:}}beautiful princess! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}I've
got an AWESOME apple for you. It's
not poisoned at all.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You want it?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ehilà, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}sbaglio o tu sei la più bella
del reame? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Senti, la vuoi una mela?
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Prendila, è squisita!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Écoute-moi bien, jeune fille{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0010:}}Cette
pomme contient des sucres lents,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
des fibres, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}et de la vitamine B1 !
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Tu devrais en manger plus !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ça te
donnera assez d'énergie pour faire
les lits de tes sept colocataires !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Se proprio vuoi saperlo, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}te lo dico{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Nella mela ci sono sali minerali,
vitamine, zuccheri, proteine e acqua.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ti basta mangiarne una per avere
le energie necessarie per preparare
sette piatti di zuppa!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}What's up, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}lady? I've got this glass
slipper here, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}and I want to stick it
on your foot.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ehilà, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}bellezza! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Ho trovato
una scarpetta di cristallo
e volevo vedere se ti stava.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}And you are my prince!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You have
finally found me,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} all thanks to my
delicate foot!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}¡Y vos sois mi príncipe!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Me habéis
encontrado gracias a mis pequeños
y delicados pies!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Oh, mon prince !{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Tu m'as
retrouvée !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Heureusement que j'ai
pas les pieds qui gonflent, hi hi hi !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}E tu sei il mio principe!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Come
hai fatto a riconoscere il mio piede
fra mille?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Hach, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}und du bist mein Prinz!
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Endlich hast du mich gefunden! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Und
dies dank meines zarten Füßchens!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Actually, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}I could tell by your calf
muscles.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} They're really well defined.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
I recognized you right away!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}En realidad, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}te he reconocido por
las pantorrillas.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Están muy bien
definidas, ¡y son inconfundibles!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Tu sais, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}j'aurais reconnu tes mollets
entre mille !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ils sont plutôt musclés
pour des mollets de fille...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}A dire il vero, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}ho riconosciuto
i tuoi polpacci.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sono molto ben
definiti, non è stato difficile!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Stimmt! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich hätte diese Altglas-
Slipper eigentlich auch gar nicht
gebraucht.
Ich hab dich gleich an deinen
Fußballer-Waden erkannt.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}
Haha!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}
